{"id": "EUVD-2026-104283", "enisaUuid": "75c3e8b3-778a-3503-a8c9-833943ca83ed", "description": "Intelligence Community UI Kit @ukic/canary-web-components 3.0.0-canary.12 before 3.0.0-canary.48 contains a DOM-based cross-site scripting vulnerability in ic-tree-item that re-parses router-item slot text as HTML. When tree item truncation is enabled, attackers who influence a tree item label can have escaped markup decoded by truncateTreeItemLabel() and executed as JavaScript in visitors' browsers.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T16:34:26", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/aaronamran/Public-Vulnerability-Disclosures/blob/main/2026/dom-xss-mi6-ic-ui-kit/README.md", "https://github.com/mi6/ic-ui-kit/commit/e0eb0f16597dcb994a75c5230cd9243647ad7b3d", "https://github.com/mi6/ic-ui-kit/blob/7b32c7c2b53b74a915f40984fb7b0a2d825fc49c/packages/canary-web-components/src/components/ic-tree-item/ic-tree-item.tsx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mi6-ukic-canary-web-components-3.0.0-canary.12-before-3.0.0-canary.48-dom-xss-via-ic-tree-item"], "aliases": ["GHSA-w4jm-jj2f-69q8", "CVE-2026-112290"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8d2aa4c8-27bc-304b-9f53-87fc9e9dea88", "product": {"name": "Intelligence Community UI Kit canary web components", "vendor": {"name": "MI6"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0-canary.12 <3.0.0-canary.48"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "940e1ae7-dcd8-386f-be22-c2cbc3d89590", "vendor": {"name": "MI6"}}], "isExploited": false}